2026-07-27T08:47:32.8005020Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:47:32.8006112Z i /tmp/RtmpazxOb6/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:47:32.8006577Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:47:32.8007106Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:47:32.8007828Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:47:32.8008586Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:47:32.8009914Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:47:32.8010696Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:47:32.8269084Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:47:32.8375857Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:47:32.8839470Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:47:32.9010530Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
